This version of liboe/oe2mbx has been tested against the Borland C Compiler version 5.5 for Windows. This compiler is freely available from http://www.borland.com/.

To make binary executable and object binary, write:
make -fmakefile.win
in the liboe/oe2mbx directory.

If you're only looking for the oe2mbx executable, there should be an already compiled version of it in the subdirectory named "bin". Please remember to read the license before distributing this software.

Stephan Nedregaard
